{"id":"6ea02f3065ba4b23","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-coproduct.md","title":"Coproduct","display":"df-coproduct — Coproduct","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-coproduct","aliases":["58-df-coproduct"],"display":"df-coproduct — Coproduct","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-coproduct"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-coproduct</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-coproduct — Coproduct"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,I,C,X,\\iota\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,I,C,X,\\iota\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coproduct}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Coproduct}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Coproduct}_S(C,\\iota,X,I,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land C\\in O\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,O)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,I,M)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(s(\\iota(i))=X(i)\\land t(\\iota(i))=C)\n\\land\\forall Y\\in O\\;\\forall g\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,I,M)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(s(g(i))=X(i)\\land t(g(i))=Y)\n\\end{array}\n\\to\n\\exists!u\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(s(u)=C\\land t(u)=Y\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(c(\\langle u,\\iota(i)\\rangle)=g(i)\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\right]\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Coproduct}_S(C,\\iota,X,I,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land C\\in O\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,O)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,I,M)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(s(\\iota(i))=X(i)\\land t(\\iota(i))=C)\n\\land\\forall Y\\in O\\;\\forall g\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,I,M)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(s(g(i))=X(i)\\land t(g(i))=Y)\n\\end{array}\n\\to\n\\exists!u\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(s(u)=C\\land t(u)=Y\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(c(\\langle u,\\iota(i)\\rangle)=g(i)\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\right]\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The category and indexing set are explicit arguments; the object/morphism carriers and composition map are unpacked from the same six-component category datum used upstream.</li>\n<li>Coproducts are categorical sums and are unique up to unique isomorphism.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,I,C,X,\\iota\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Coproduct}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coproduct}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Coproduct}_S(C,\\iota,X,I,\\mathcal C)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists O,M,s,t,c,e\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land C\\in O\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,O)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota,I,M)\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(s(\\iota(i))=X(i)\\land t(\\iota(i))=C)\n\\land\\forall Y\\in O\\;\\forall g\\in V\\;\n\\left[\n\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathrm{Function}(g,I,M)\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;(s(g(i))=X(i)\\land t(g(i))=Y)\n\\end{array}\n\\to\n\\exists!u\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(s(u)=C\\land t(u)=Y\\land\n\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(c(\\langle u,\\iota(i)\\rangle)=g(i)\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\right]\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1445,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-370","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-coproduct.md|58-df-coproduct]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a87b7e1119b63b2c","36d7463d215be751"]}